{"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","author_sig":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","data":{"content_hash":"850d189b0c04671716dfa5290d42da0c1ef606dbab4e4b842817571bc26896ff","digest":{"component_or_area":"Jira outbound comment sync / reconcile-bridge workflow","key_entities":["comment_ids","RECONCILER_MARKER","<!-- rebar:reconciler-echo -->","outbound_comments.py","_decorate_outbound_comment","_normalize_comment_body","_TRUNCATION_SUFFIX","adapters/jira/comment_limits.py","reconcile-bridge.yml","bd80-0603-7d44-4d9f","aa7b-5e47-6d3d-4615","REB-1861","REB-1567","REB-1931","REB-2605","712020:6471376f-4e5e-4ed2-8c05-330827bc387e","GET /rest/api/3/issue/{key}/comment"],"problem_keywords":["jira","duplicate comments","comment sync","outbound sync","data cleanup","reconciler","deduplication","comment-id map","bot comments"],"propositions":["The primary comment-id dedup map is inert/empty, causing the outbound comment sync to re-post duplicate comments to Jira on every hourly pass until the workflow was manually paused.","REB-1861 reached Jira's 5000-comment hard cap and fails with COMMENTS_PER_ISSUE_LIMIT_EXCEEDED when new comments attempt to land.","30 affected issues accumulated 31,683 total comments with 30,847 bot-marked duplicates and 836 unmarked truncation-suffix comments across three issues (REB-1567, REB-1931, REB-2605).","Phase 1 deletion was executed and verified: 29,931 duplicate comments deleted across 27 issues using pre-strip marker detection, with keep-oldest-per-distinct-normalized-body rule and independent post-deletion verification showing zero missing bodies.","Phase 2 (836 truncation-suffix comments) was deliberately not executed pending operator decision, identified as a separate evidence-gated candidate class due to marker loss during outbound truncation at 32767 chars."]},"digest_hash_version":1,"model":"bedrock:us.anthropic.claude-opus-4-8","schema":"ticket_digest_v1"},"env_id":"b8a354e0-12c3-4cf2-bbf1-fcc9685d5126","event_type":"TICKET_DIGEST","timestamp":1787276577903931001,"uuid":"c64e7819-ddbc-46a3-a413-a60f5f9697fd"}